Priya: Heads-up 1: NebulaCloud co-marketing confirmed. We need a compact launch plan: marketplace listing, a short benchmark blog (TL;DR + appendix), a 45-min joint webinar, and quick assets for social. Owners?
Ellis: Ill draft marketplace listing + 3-line explainer for the marketplace card. Will include 2 screenshots and 1 GIF. Target: Fri 6/28.
Mateo: I can run the benchmark and record a 90s highlight clip. Thinking metrics: median token latency, token cost per 1k, and end-to-end p95 for the demo prompt set. Also will capture config: batching=16, kv-cache enabled, int8 quant.
Claire: Webinar logistics 1: proposed dates Tue 7/9 or Thu 7/11 @ 11am PT. We should gate recording behind a form and test the partner's SSO. I can do registration + confirmation flows.
Sam (Design): Will produce hero, 3 social cards, and a short animated thumbnail for the webinar. Need partner logo assets and preferred brand colors. Will ship first drafts 6/30.
Ellis: Inbound routing plan: Salesforce form `nebula_market_inbound` collects name/company,email,utm_source,utm_campaign. Route to SF queue "platform-integrations", tag record with "nebula_launch" and set lead owner to Ellis for 72h. Also add lead source mapping for Nebula partner ID.
Priya: Messaging iteration: two headline variants for testing: A) "Run production LLMs cheaper with NebulaCloud + Redwood" B) "Slash inference cost 2x for retrieval workloads" — let's A/B test on social and partner email.
Mateo: Dev snippet to preserve UTM on the landing page (put before form):
```
(function(){
  var params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
  var utm = {src: params.get('utm_source')||'marketplace', camp: params.get('utm_campaign')||'nebula_launch'};
  localStorage.setItem('nebulaUTM', JSON.stringify(utm));
  document.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
    var form = e.target;
    if(form && form.querySelector('[name=utm_source]')){
      var stored = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('nebulaUTM')||'{}');
      form.querySelector('[name=utm_source]').value = stored.src || '';
      form.querySelector('[name=utm_campaign]').value = stored.camp || '';
    }
  }, true);
})();
```
Claire: Promo plan: partner newsletter, Redwood PLG weekly, 4 organic posts across LinkedIn/X, and a $1k paid test on LinkedIn (target: platform engineers & infra leads). We'll test CTA: "Watch demo" vs "Download benchmark".
Priya: Legal check: no customer PII in demo. @legal already asked for redaction checklist. Can someone ping them about the appendix?
Mateo: Pinged legal just now. They requested the raw benchmark config and the dataset subset used for perf runs. Will redact any customer traces.
launch-bot: Salesforce workflow `nebula_market_inbound` created and webhook OK. Test lead created: ID SF-998877.
Priya: Owners & deadlines: Ellis 1: marketplace copy 6/28; Mateo 1: benchmark + clip 7/3; Claire 1: webinar invites + registration 7/1; Sam 1: design comps 6/30. I'll assemble the launch checklist and schedule a 20-min dry run with Nebula one week before the webinar. :sparkles:
